<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Sheffield Shield results.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Sheffield Shield results.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Sheffield Shield matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>In Sydney: Tasmania 463-7 declared  and 290 for five declared (Jamie Cox 125, Dene Hills 75), New South Wales 449 and 305 for four (Michael Slater 79, Shane Lee 75 not out, Rodney Davison 63, Jason Arnberger 57). NSW won by six wickets.</p>
<p>In Brisbane: Queensland 277 and 218 (Matthew Mott 60, Stuart Law 50), South Australia 160 and 198 (Martin Faull 64). Queensland won by 137 runs.</p>
</text>
